# Jeremiah Payson's cockroaches in the Undercity.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, Cockroach; the new Plagued and
# Undercity Cockroaches); Forever's client data 1.60.1.70532 (ItemSparse
# prices: 50s each; every pet item teaches its companion when used).

step Jeremiah Payson
  tip Jeremiah Payson sells three cockroaches in the Undercity (50s each, 1g 50s for all three); the Plagued and Undercity Cockroaches are new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 8403                         -- Jeremiah Payson
  buy 10393 npc 8403 optional         -- Cockroach, 50s
  buy 280697 "Plagued Cockroach" npc 8403 optional -- 50s
  buy 280699 "Undercity Cockroach" npc 8403 optional -- 50s
